## 🧠 Key Learnings

### JOINs

JOINs allow related data from multiple tables to be combined into one query.

### Transactions

Transactions help keep related database operations consistent.

### `commit()`

Saves the changes made during a transaction.

### `rollback()`

Undo uncommitted changes when something goes wrong.

### Functions

Functions make database operations reusable and improve code organization.

